        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "After updating LuaLS and reading closely about what it means by \"tuple\", I realized that I misunderstood its meaning. I thought it was about separate return values as `MiniIcons.get()` returns, but in reality it is about tables with fixed number of number fields.\r\n\r\nSo the return value is now `...` (as in other modules for functions which return several separate values). This is (hopefully) a temporary solution until the 'mini.doc' update to better support LuaCATS.",
